imate matter to which the living would 'return'; it is present\nin the living in the form of a subjective and differenciated experience\nendowed with its prototype. It is not a material state; on the contrary,\n"], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-large"}}, "key": "embeddings_4e4836307cd1575a8c170e4e70331a35d41842f2f566ae4db427bcabfbb3bf1f_v2"}